        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.133,
          "end": 5.466,
          "en": "- [Maximilian] So now that we know what Code Interpreter is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.466,
          "end": 8.766,
          "en": "and how it works and which restrictions apply,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.766,
          "end": 10.266,
          "en": "let's start using it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.266,
          "end": 12.066,
          "en": "and let's start diving in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.066,
          "end": 14.533,
          "en": "to some important prompting techniques.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.533,
          "end": 15.833,
          "en": "But of course, first of all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.833,
          "end": 20.133,
          "en": "you have to make sure that you can really use this feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.266,
          "end": 24.8,
          "en": "You will find a ChatGPT option with Code Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.8,
          "end": 27.533,
          "en": "when selecting the GPT-4 model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.666,
          "end": 32.266,
          "en": "And once you enabled that specific version of the model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.266,
          "end": 35.533,
          "en": "or that version that has this Code Interpreter unlocked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.533,
          "end": 36.733,
          "en": "to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.733,
          "end": 38.833,
          "en": "you are ready to use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.833,
          "end": 40.833,
          "en": "And now with that enabled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.833,
          "end": 44.433,
          "en": "ChatGPT will try to use Code Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.433,
          "end": 47.5,
          "en": "if it helps ChatGPT solve a certain problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.5,
          "end": 48.733,
          "en": "in a better way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.733,
          "end": 52,
          "en": "or if it allows ChatGPT to solve a problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52,
          "end": 55.233,
          "en": "it would not be able to solve otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.233,
          "end": 58.8,
          "en": "For example, with Code Interpreter enabled and selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.8,
          "end": 61.166,
          "en": "we could now ask ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.166,
          "end": 65.4,
          "en": "to generate 20 random integer numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.4,
          "end": 68.7,
          "en": "which are simply numbers without decimal places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.7,
          "end": 71.6,
          "en": "between 1 and 100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.833,
          "end": 76.76599999999999,
          "en": "And now, instead of guessing or predicting such numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.76599999999999,
          "end": 79.76599999999999,
          "en": "as ChatGPT might normally do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.76599999999999,
          "end": 82.5,
          "en": "it will indeed generate some Python code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.5,
          "end": 84.43299999999999,
          "en": "and execute that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.43299999999999,
          "end": 87.8,
          "en": "and then give us the result of that code execution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.066,
          "end": 93.5,
          "en": "Now, what's great about this Code Interpreter feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.5,
          "end": 97,
          "en": "is that by default, all the work that's being performed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97,
          "end": 98.6,
          "en": "is hidden from you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.6,
          "end": 101.7,
          "en": "so that if you don't have a programming background,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.7,
          "end": 104.233,
          "en": "you don't have to deal with the details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.233,
          "end": 106.066,
          "en": "of what just happened.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.066,
          "end": 108.033,
          "en": "But if you wanna take a closer look,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.033,
          "end": 111.93299999999999,
          "en": "you can do that by clicking here on Show work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.93299999999999,
          "end": 113.366,
          "en": "And once you do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.366,
          "end": 117.833,
          "en": "you'll see the actual code that was generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.833,
          "end": 121.3,
          "en": "and the result of executing that code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.3,
          "end": 124.266,
          "en": "though, that result is then of course also output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.266,
          "end": 127.8,
          "en": "in a prettier way by ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.8,
          "end": 130.1,
          "en": "What's also important to note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.1,
          "end": 133.2,
          "en": "is that when using Code Interpreter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 135.3,
          "en": "a single chat session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.3,
          "end": 137.733,
          "en": "so all the messages in a single chat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.733,
          "end": 141.166,
          "en": "share the same execution environment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.166,
          "end": 144.4,
          "en": "Therefore, if I now send a follow-up message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.4,
          "end": 149.4,
          "en": "like multiply every number with two,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.03300000000002,
          "end": 154.9,
          "en": "ChatGPT will again use Code Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.9,
          "end": 156.666,
          "en": "but it will use Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.666,
          "end": 159.6,
          "en": "in that same execution environment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.6,
          "end": 161.933,
          "en": "And therefore here, if we take a closer look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.933,
          "end": 163.5,
          "en": "at the work performed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.5,
          "end": 165.133,
          "en": "you can actually see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.133,
          "end": 169.166,
          "en": "that it uses the same random numbers variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.166,
          "end": 171.166,
          "en": "as it's called in programming,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.166,
          "end": 176,
          "en": "that was generated in the previous response from ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.133,
          "end": 181.133,
          "en": "So instead of regenerating the entire code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.133,
          "end": 184.8,
          "en": "and losing results from previous calculations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.8,
          "end": 186.633,
          "en": "it keeps those results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.633,
          "end": 189.6,
          "en": "and it keeps the same execution environment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.6,
          "end": 193.133,
          "en": "and we can build up on those previous responses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.133,
          "end": 196.733,
          "en": "and on the results from previous code executions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.733,
          "end": 199.733,
